   "motion": "Commissioner Wright – I move that we send a positive recommendation to the City Council for File #5Z23 for an amendment to the Land Development Code related to Chapter 13.25, Sections 13.36.020, 13.36.090, 13.36.130, 13.36.170, 13.36.210 as specified in the Staff Report. With the addition to 13.25.020, paragraph 4 Front Landscape, to say: “Front landscape areas shall include a combination of trees, rocks, gravel, and plant materials. Plant materials shall cover a minimum of 25% of the landscaped area”",
